  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a> <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the answer key for the post of Assistant Agriculture Engineer.&nbsp;</span></span>This recruitment was released for 1100 posts. Applications for the Rajasthan RPSC Assistant Agriculture Engineer Recruitment 2025 were accepted from 28 July 2025 to 26 August 2025. The written examination was on 19 April 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their RPSC Assistant Agriculture Engineer AAE Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">RPSC Assistant Agriculture Engineer AAE Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">RPSC Advt No 03/2025-26</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>17 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000